WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The panel opens on Settings and scrolls to the theme picker.

00:05.000 --> 00:19.500
The theme changes from Linen to Obsidian, Voxel, Pixel Meadow and Mochi, and back to Linen.

00:19.500 --> 00:28.400
The panel closes. After a few quiet seconds the pill rests as two round eyes that look toward the moving cursor and blink.

00:28.400 --> 00:35.900
In the Voxel theme the same close-up shows square pixel eyes that follow the cursor.
